<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Growth alone not enough to cut jobless-RBA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Growth alone not enough to cut jobless-RBA.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retiring Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) governor Bernie Fraser said on Thursday sustained economic growth alone was not enough to bring down the jobless rate.</p>
<p>&quot;Even when you've got a good sustained rate of growth going, I suspect that that's not going to be enough to reduce unemployment to the level that we'd like to see it reduced, whatever that might be, whether it's six (percent) or five or four or whatever,&quot; Fraser told a parliamentary committee.</p>
</text>
